 BOTSv2 - Authentication Failure Investigation
 SPL queries used during the investigation


1. Failed Logons by Host
Purpose: Initial triage to identify the host with thehighest number of Windows failed logon events.


index="botsv2" earliest=0 (EventCode=4625 OR EventID=4625)
| stats count by host
| sort - count



2. Failed Authentication Over Time
Purpose: Identify temporal patterns and spikes infailed authentication activity.


index="botsv2" earliest=0 (EventCode=4625 OR EventID=4625)
| timechart span=5m count


3. Source Address and Account Correlation
Purpose: Investigate failed logons on mercury and correlate source addresses with accounts and logon types.


index="botsv2" earliest=0 host="mercury" (EventCode=4625 OR EventID=4625)
| stats count values(Account_Name) as Accounts values(Logon_Type) as LogonType by Source_Network_Address
| sort - count




4. Administrator Authentication Failure Details
Purpose: Inspect failed authentication events originating from 10.0.1.220 in greater detail.


index="botsv2" earliest=0 host="mercury" EventCode=4625 Source_Network_Address="10.0.1.220"
| table _time Source_Network_Address Account_Name Logon_Type Failure_Reason
| sort _time



5. Successful Logon Correlation
Purpose: Check whether the same source successfully authenticated to the Administrator account.


index="botsv2" earliest=0 host="mercury" EventCode=4624 Source_Network_Address="10.0.1.220" Account_Name="Administrator"
| stats count earliest(_time) as FirstSuccess latest(_time) as LastSuccess
| convert ctime(FirstSuccess) ctime(LastSuccess)




6. Authentication Periodicity Analysis
Purpose: Calculate intervals between failed Administrator authentication events to identify recurring behavior.


index="botsv2" earliest=0 host="mercury" EventCode=4625 Source_Network_Address="10.0.1.220" Account_Name="Administrator"
| sort 0 _time
| streamstats current=f last(_time) as PreviousAttempt
| eval IntervalSeconds=_time-PreviousAttempt
| stats min(IntervalSeconds) as MinInterval avg(IntervalSeconds) as AvgInterval median(IntervalSeconds) as MedianInterval max(IntervalSeconds) as MaxInterval




7. Authentication Context
Purpose: Summarize authentication characteristics for the investigated Administrator failures.


index=botsv2 earliest=0 host=mercury EventCode=4625 Source_Network_Address="10.0.1.220" Account_Name="Administrator"
| stats count as Failures values(Logon_Type) as LogonType values(Logon_Process) as LogonProcess values(Authentication_Package) as AuthenticationPackage values(Workstation_Name) as Workstation




8. Network Telemetry Correlation
Purpose: Correlate the suspected source address with network connections observed in Splunk Stream telemetry.


index=botsv2 earliest=0 sourcetype="stream:tcp" (src_ip="10.0.1.220" OR dest_ip="10.0.1.220")
| stats count by src_ip dest_ip src_port dest_port
| sort - count
| head 30
